+/* Coalesce partial SACKs inside a <=32-MSS TSO skb via scb->tx.sacked_bmap
+ * during normal TCP_CA_Open reordering, avoiding O(N) skb_split/RB-rebalance.
+ * Returns: 0 = fallback to shift/fragment, 1 = whole skb SACKed, 2 = recorded.
